{
  "vendor": "leadsforge",
  "name": "Leadsforge",
  "category": "enrichment",
  "summary": "B2B lead search with email, phone and LinkedIn enrichment, lookalike companies, company followers and Google Maps business discovery.",
  "docs_url": "https://api.leadsforge.ai/public/swagger/index.html",
  "base_url": "https://api.leadsforge.ai/public/v1",
  "auth": {
    "credentials": {
      "api_key": {
        "env": [
          "LEADSFORGE_API_KEY"
        ],
        "description": "a Leadsforge API key (API settings in your Leadsforge account)"
      }
    },
    "inject": [
      {
        "in": "header",
        "name": "Authorization",
        "value": "{api_key}"
      }
    ]
  },
  "notes": [
    "The Swagger file declares an apiKey in the Authorization header; this entry sends the bare key with no Bearer prefix.",
    "Credits: search gives 1,000 free requests a month (each cursor page counts), then 1 credit; email enrichment 1 credit per hit, phone 10 per hit, misses free; lookalike search 1 credit per company, preview 300 free a month. GET /balance lists the current prices.",
    "Async flow for enrichment, company followers and Sales Navigator: start a job (returns a jobID), poll its status endpoint until status is completed, then page through the results endpoint with offset and limit. A webhookURL can be given instead of polling.",
    "Send an Idempotency-Key header on job starts to retry safely: a repeat returns the existing job instead of charging again.",
    "Controlled search filters (industries, seniorities, departments, company types, funding types, revenue ranges) need exact values from the /search/filters endpoints, which this entry leaves out.",
    "Left out because they write to the user's account: Google Maps discovery, which creates a list in the app, and the batch calls' saveToList, which saves results to a lead list."
  ],
  "sources": [
    "https://api.leadsforge.ai/public/swagger/doc.json"
  ],
  "curated": "2026-11-08",
  "endpoints": [
    {
      "id": "leadsforge.account.balance",
      "name": "Get credit balance",
      "summary": "Available and reserved credits, and the price of each enrichment and search type.",
      "kind": "read",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/balance",
      "job": "account.usage",
      "docs_url": "https://api.leadsforge.ai/public/swagger/doc.json",
      "verified": {
        "docs": "https://api.leadsforge.ai/public/swagger/doc.json"
      },
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "leadsforge.people.search",
      "name": "Search people",
      "summary": "People matching company and person filters, paged by cursor.",
      "kind": "read",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/search",
      "params": {
        "cursor": {
          "in": "query",
          "type": "string",
          "description": "The cursor from the previous page."
        },
        "companyDomains": {
          "in": "body",
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Company domains. {include: [...], exclude: [...]}."
        },
        "companyIndustries": {
          "in": "body",
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Industries, exact values from /search/filters/industries. {include: [...], exclude: [...]}."
        },
        "companyLocations": {
          "in": "body",
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Company locations. {include: [...], exclude: [...]}."
        },
        "companyKeywords": {
          "in": "body",
          "type": "object",
          "description": "{include, exclude, matchAll}: company keywords."
        },
        "companyEmployeeNumberRange": {
          "in": "body",
          "type": "object",
          "description": "{min, max} employee count."
        },
        "companyRevenueRanges": {
          "in": "body",
          "type": "array",
          "description": "Revenue range values from /search/filters/revenue-ranges."
        },
        "companyTechnologies": {
          "in": "body",
          "type": "object",
          "description": "{all: [...], any: [...]} technologies used."
        },
        "companyNames": {
          "in": "body",
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Company names. {include: [...], exclude: [...]}."
        },
        "leadJobTitles": {
          "in": "body",
          "type": "object",
          "description": "{include, exclude, exactMatch} job titles; free text."
        },
        "leadSeniorities": {
          "in": "body",
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Seniorities, exact values from /search/filters/seniorities. {include: [...], exclude: [...]}."
        },
        "leadDepartments": {
          "in": "body",
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Departments, exact values from /search/filters/departments. {include: [...], exclude: [...]}."
        },
        "leadLocations": {
          "in": "body",
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Person locations. {include: [...], exclude: [...]}."
        },
        "maxContactsPerCompany": {
          "in": "body",
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "Cap on people returned per company."
        },
        "limit": {
          "in": "body",
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "Results to return."
        }
      },
      "notes": [
        "A read over POST. The first 1,000 requests a month are free; every cursor page counts as one request.",
        "Pass a returned person id to the enrichment calls to get an email or phone."
      ],
      "job": "people.search",
      "docs_url": "https://api.leadsforge.ai/public/swagger/doc.json",
      "verified": {
        "docs": "https://api.leadsforge.ai/public/swagger/doc.json"
      }
